  "description": "<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Hello! We are excited to introduce you to N-2 Water! We are a new to the market hydration brand on a mission to transform your daily water bottle into a source of wellness! N-2 Water is an on-the-go hydration stick that adds ocean sourced calcium and magnesium (calcium from sea weed and magnesium from sea water) and ocean salt - providing 130mg of calcium, 130 mg of magnesium and over 70 other trace minerals back into your water.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><br>&bull; Product description: N-2 Water comes in 4 energizing flavors (Lemonade, Peach Lemonade, Grapefruit, and Margarita) and has a simple, 5 ingredient label - with no added sugar and is 100% all natural.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><br>&bull; USP (Unique Selling Point): Unlike other hdyration products on the market, N-2 Water sources all it's functional ingredients from the ocean - calcium from seaweed, magnesium from sea water, and sodium from ocean salt, adding 70 other trace minerals into your water. In addition, N-2 Water is doctor formulated and family owned!</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">&bull; Payment terms: Net 30 (30 days after the end of the month in which the sales occurred)</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><br>&bull; Other information: We would love to send you a sample pack so you can try our product!</p>",
